{"locales":{"en":{"fo13oqa9u1":{"lh_5bw_9j7xan_html":"MAKE YOUR KEYBOARD LOOK MORE LIKE SPACE HARDWARE.<br>","description_html":"<div>Front + Back Hollow aluminum accents turn your ESC, ENTER, and SPACEBAR into machined details inspired by spacecraft structures and orbital equipment.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>&nbsp;\u00b7 CNC ALUMINUM<\/div><div>&nbsp;\u00b7 REAL HOLLOW STRUCTURE<\/div><div>&nbsp;\u00b7 3-KEY ACCENT SET<\/div>","btn_html":"<a href=\"#product\" data-ga-action=\"btn\" data-ga-label=\"Button\" data-lhlink>BRING TO YOUR BOARD<\/a>"},"685erx33sqg":{"lh_5bw_9j7xan_html":"YOUR SETUP LOOKS FUTURISTIC. YOUR KEYBOARD SHOULD TOO.<br><div><div><\/div><\/div>","description_html":"<div><b>Your lighting, PC, monitor, mousepad, and accessories may already feel like parts of the same world.&nbsp;<\/b><\/div><div><b><br><\/b><\/div><div><b>Then the keyboard sits in the center with the same solid plastic keys as every other board.&nbsp;<\/b><\/div><div><b><br><\/b><\/div><div><b>The Hollow 3-Key Set adds a different kind of detail:&nbsp;<\/b><\/div><div><b>Open structure, machined metal, and hardware-inspired geometry.&nbsp;<\/b><\/div><div><b><br><\/b><\/div><div><b>Less like another keyboard accessory.&nbsp;<\/b><\/div><div><b>More like part of the equipment.<\/b><\/div>","btn_html":"<a href=\"#product\" data-ga-action=\"btn\" data-ga-label=\"Button\" data-lhlink>PREORDER THE HOLLOW 3-KEY SET<\/a>"},"bur5hr5a124":{"lh_5bw_9j7xan_html":"<div>THE HOLLOW STRUCTURE IS THE SCI-FI DETAIL.<div><div><\/div><\/div><\/div>","description_html":"<div><b>The space-station look doesn't come from a graphic printed on the keycap.&nbsp;<\/b><\/div><div><b><br><\/b><\/div><div><b>It comes from what's missing.&nbsp;<\/b><\/div><div><b><br><\/b><\/div><div><b>The front and back openings expose the structure of the key and create the kind of negative space found in frames, panels, and engineered components.&nbsp;<\/b><\/div><div><b><br><\/b><\/div><div><b>No space graphics needed.&nbsp;<\/b><\/div><div><b>The geometry does the work.<\/b><\/div>","btn_html":"<a href=\"#product\" data-ga-action=\"btn\" data-ga-label=\"Button\" data-lhlink>PREORDER THE HOLLOW 3-KEY SET<\/a>"},"45fb0eavcr":{"lh_5bw_9j7xan_html":"BUILT FROM THE MATERIAL SPACE HARDWARE SHOULD FEEL LIKE.<br>","description_html":"<div>Plastic can imitate metal.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>This doesn't.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Each keycap is CNC-machined from aluminum, giving the hollow structure sharper edges, real reflections, and the feel of a machined component.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Cold metal.&nbsp;<\/div><div>Exposed structure.&nbsp;<\/div><div>Engineered detail.<\/div>","btn_html":"<a href=\"#product\" data-ga-action=\"btn\" data-ga-label=\"Button\" data-lhlink>PREORDER THE HOLLOW 3-KEY SET<\/a>"},"luojdhnu9u":{"lh_5bw_9j7xan_html":"<div>LET YOUR SETUP LIGHT GET INSIDE THE DESIGN.<\/div>","description_html":"<div>The hollow openings create spaces where highlights and shadows can form.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Under RGB or ambient lighting, the aluminum reflects the colors around it while the cutouts stay dark and dimensional.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Your lighting doesn't just hit the keycap.&nbsp;<\/div><div>It becomes part of how the keycap looks.<\/div>","btn_html":"<a href=\"#product\" data-ga-action=\"btn\" data-ga-label=\"Button\" data-lhlink>PREORDER THE HOLLOW 3-KEY SET<\/a>"},"4ke907dyut9":{"lh_5bw_9j7xan_html":"<div>THREE HARDWARE DETAILS. SPREAD ACROSS THE KEYBOARD.<\/div>","description_html":"<div>The design isn't limited to one ESC key sitting in the corner.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>It appears across three familiar control points:&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>ESC&nbsp;<\/div><div>A small hardware detail in the upper corner.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>ENTER&nbsp;<\/div><div>A second structural accent in the main cluster.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>SPACEBAR&nbsp;<\/div><div>The largest hollow piece across the bottom row.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Together, they carry the space-hardware theme across the board without covering every key in metal.<\/div>","btn_html":"<a href=\"#product\" data-ga-action=\"btn\" data-ga-label=\"Button\" data-lhlink>PREORDER THE HOLLOW 3-KEY SET<\/a>"},"gnz7u130h3t":{"lh_5bw_9j7xan_html":"<div>SCI-FI WITHOUT LOOKING LIKE A THEMED KEYCAP SET.<\/div>","description_html":"<div>No planets.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>No astronauts.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>No giant printed graphics.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>The sci-fi character comes from material, structure, proportion, and light.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Inspired by space hardware\u2014not space merch.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>INSPIRED BY SPACE HARDWARE\u2014NOT SPACE MERCH.<\/div>","btn_html":"<a href=\"#product\" data-ga-action=\"btn\" data-ga-label=\"Button\" data-lhlink>PREORDER THE HOLLOW 3-KEY SET<\/a>"},"qlpexuas":{"lh_5bw_9j7xan_html":"<div>KEEP YOUR CURRENT KEYCAPS. ADD THE HARDWARE.<\/div>","description_html":"<div>You don't need to turn the entire keyboard into metal.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Keep the colorway and keycaps that already fit your setup.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Add the hollow aluminum structure where it gets noticed.  Three accents.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>One new layer of hardware.<\/div>","btn_html":"<a href=\"#product\" data-ga-action=\"btn\" data-ga-label=\"Button\" data-lhlink>PREORDER THE HOLLOW 3-KEY SET<\/a>"},"ec3a0gukno5":{"lh_up5omg_outstock":"Out of stock","lh_up5omg_new":"New","lh_up5omg_sale":"Sale ","lh_k4hsr9_out":"Sold out","lh_a168_title_html":"BRING SPACE HARDWARE TO THE CENTER OF YOUR SETUP<br>","lh_up5omg_quantity":"QUANTITY","lh_up5omg_buynow":"PRE-ORDER NOW","lh_a168_desc_html":"<div><b>PRE-ORDER NOW FOR $24.99.&nbsp;<\/b><\/div><div><b><br><\/b><\/div><div><b>ESTIMATED TO SHIP 4\u20136 WEEKS AFTER THE PRE-ORDER CLOSES.&nbsp;<\/b><\/div><div><b><br><\/b><\/div><div><b>PRE-ORDER CANCELLATIONS ARE GENERALLY NOT ACCEPTED; IF APPROVED, A $5 CANCELLATION FEE PER SKU WILL BE DEDUCTED FROM THE REFUND.<\/b><\/div><div><br><\/div><ul>\n  <li data-lh-list=\"\">Premium aluminum alloy construction<\/li>\n  <li data-lh-list=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: calc(var(--lh-font-size) * 1); letter-spacing: var(--text-letter-spacing);\">Hollow aluminum structure enhances natural resonance and high-fidelity acoustics<\/span><\/li>\n  <li data-lh-list=\"\">Available in Silver x Metallic Gray x Black color<\/li>\n  <li data-lh-list=\"\">OEM profile height for a familiar and comfortable typing experience<\/li><\/ul><!--lh-live-editor-->"},"y9a0pqi6h0f":{"heading":"Images Gallery"},"cj6uy6outy8":{"lh_a168_title":"DESIGNED TO STAND OUT"},"0af8e6iawx9a":{"title":"A COCKPIT-INSPIRED DESK UPGRADE","des_html":"Inspired by spacecraft panels, orbital stations, and galaxy-lit control rooms, the hollow aluminum form is made to turn your keyboard into part of a sci-fi setup.<!--lh-live-editor-->","loading":"Loading image"},"jx8a8ragqt":{"lh_a168_title":"DETAILS THAT CATCH THE LIGHT"},"kmbygv9gia":{"lh_90w0d4_title":"FAQ","lh_ezc4q5_name":"Will these keycaps fit my keyboard?","lh_ezc4q5_content_html":"They are designed for MX-style mechanical switches. Please check your keyboard layout before purchasing the full set.<br><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezhhnw_name":"What set options are available?","lh_ezhhnw_content_html":"The main option is 3-Key Accent Set.<br><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezmuln_name":"Are these plastic or metal?","lh_ezmuln_content_html":"They are made from aluminum with an electroplated finish.<br><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezs7je_name":"Is the keyboard included?","lh_ezs7je_content_html":"No. This product includes keycaps only.<br><!--lh-live-editor-->"}}},"name":"Standard page"}
